<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222; line-height: 1.6;">

<p>{{greeting}}</p>

<p>I’m {{sender_name}}, a {{degree}} student at {{college}} graduating in {{graduation_year}}, reaching out to see if {{company}} has openings for AI/ML or full-stack software interns.</p>

<p>I’ve worked on projects across AI and full-stack development—including MedGaurd, a graph-backed medical AI assistant—and I’m eager to contribute to {{company}}&rsquo;s engineering work while learning from your team.</p>

<p>If you have any upcoming internship cycles or a quick 5–10 minutes to point me toward the right team or hiring process, I’d really appreciate a brief chat. My resume is attached, along with my work below:</p>

{% if linkedin %}<p>LinkedIn: <a href="{{linkedin}}">{{linkedin}}</a></p>{% endif %}
{% if github %}<p>GitHub: <a href="{{github}}">{{github}}</a></p>{% endif %}
{% if portfolio %}<p>Portfolio: <a href="{{portfolio}}">{{portfolio}}</a></p>{% endif %}

<p>Thanks for your time,</p>

<p>
{{sender_name}}<br>
{% if phone %}📞 {{phone}}<br>{% endif %}
{% if email %}✉️ {{email}}<br>{% endif %}
</p>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #888;">If you'd prefer not to receive emails like this, just reply and I won't write again.</p>

</body>
</html>
